      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Better repro: avtr_e605b780-0a6b-42a2-a77a-a55e07f0a9d7 (this one is a public avatar)\nIn this avatar, you should see a sphere right in front of your face. In the unity 2018 version, the sphere appears on MirrorReflection but is invisible on PlayerLocal.\n\nIn this particular case I didn't reupload for unity 2018, but I've been able to reproduce the issue with reuploaded avatars as well.",
